		// The library default (FP_DIGITS=0, what the TCL test suite runs
		// with) produces the shortest string that round-trips to the same
		// double (e.g. -1.1099999999999999 for 1.23-2.34, since -1.11 has a
		// different bit pattern). sqlite3_db_config FP_DIGITS N (>0) fixes
